$guides=[
'mini-excavator-cost-2026'=>['What to include in an excavator quotation','Compare the quotation scope, not only the headline price.','Ask whether the quote includes the selected attachments, documentation, packing and delivery scope.','Specify the model configuration, quantity, destination and preferred delivery terms. Compare offers on the same basis.'],
