'gradall-vs-excavator'=>['Compare machines by the work they need to do','Build a task-based shortlist before comparing equipment categories.','Write down required reach, working depth, ground conditions and access restrictions.','Compare manufacturer documentation for the proposed configurations. Category names alone do not establish suitability or operating limits.'],
