'9-types-excavator-buckets'=>['Specify an attachment with the machine','A useful attachment enquiry includes the tool and its interface requirements.','Describe the material and the intended task, not only the attachment name.','Confirm coupler dimensions, hydraulic flow and pressure where relevant, and compatibility with the selected machine. Request written confirmation.'],
'start-landscaping-business-equipment'=>['Build a landscaping equipment shortlist','Let recurring jobs and site access guide the shortlist.','List the work you expect to repeat and measure common access constraints.','Compare transport requirements, attachments and service arrangements alongside machine dimensions. Avoid selecting purely on maximum capacity.'],
